			<div class="content" id="post-content-4834119">
									

<p>Hey kettleworks, welcome to the site! Take your time as there is no rush to adding to the site. Glad to see your friend has good taste, and helps let others know about this place too! I'd dive into the articles if I were you and you can certainly find some gems all through the series.<br />
As for writing, just make sure you go through the proper greenlighting process on the idea forums first. Remember that there is no rush, and you should take time familiarizing yourself with how Series 6 articles are formatted. We are a rather unique bunch so I'm sure just reading and being a part of the community will be rather fun for you! For my recommendation, you should check out <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4001">SCP-4001</a> it's a library, that isn't quite as boring as the ones we have today. Rather, it's a unique spin on a once great collection of knowledge.</p>
